{title: Round the Bonfire}
{artist: Ember Kids}

{start_of_intro: Intro}
| [G]  | [C]  | [G]  | [D]  |
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Sticks and stories ro[C]und the bonfire light
[G]Marshmallows burning o[D]n a summer night
[G]Someone's got a guitar [C]with a broken string
[G]Everybody knows [D]the words, so ev[G]erybody sing
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus x2}
[C]Round the bonfi[G]re, round the bonfire
[D]Sing it till the morn[G]ing (x2)
{comment: (x2)}
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Sparks are climbing li[C]ke they want to fly
[G]Writing little letter[D]s on the sky
[G]Somebody's asleep un[C]der a borrowed coat
[G]Dreaming of a r[D]iver and a woode[G]n boat
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus x2}
[C]Round the bonfi[G]re, round the bonfire
[D]Sing it till the morn[G]ing (x2)
{end_of_chorus}

{chorus: Chorus}
